// [Payment ledger 2026-06] "Sổ thu tiền" — record when a client actually paid,
// per (client, workspace=month), independent of invoices (regular clients pay
// directly without one). Multiple rows per client = partial / installment
// payments; the ledger sums them. Scalar-only FK-ish fields by design — it's
// self-contained and the action layer (payment-actions.ts) enforces ADMIN +
// workspace scoping explicitly, mirroring share-portal-actions.
model Payment {
